WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:04.463
♪♪

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:06.089
Inspector:
Natalie Thompson!

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.383
(Click)

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.927
(Click)

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.303
(Click)

00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:12.721
I know you've already been
asked,

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:14.973
but for the sake of the
camera,

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:16.850
are you sure you don't want
legal representation?

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:17.851
I don't need it.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:21.688
I can tell you that you've been
arrested on suspicion of conspiracy to abduct Leo Newman.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:22.856
No comment.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:23.482
(Sigh)

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:24.149
Nope.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.777
There's obviously been some sort
of misunderstanding.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:33.367
We can't be certain whether 
this is terrorist related,
politically motivated or simple extortion.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:33.825
♪♪

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:38.163
Young guy, Leo Newman, gets
packed into a suitcase by a
masked gang.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:38.956
♪♪

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:40.791
Scott:
NYPD flags four suspects.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.167
♪♪

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.252
Interviewer:
Catherine Newman,

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:46.004
Interviewer:
I cannot imagine what you're
going through at the moment.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.880
I love my son.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:49.424
And I want him back.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.551
♪♪

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.761
We're being set up.

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:53.762
Sean:
Why us?

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:56.014
Aadesh:
I don't know why.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.099
Sean:
What do we have in common?

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.684
Tara:
We're all British.

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:01.937
And we were all in New York on
the day Leo Newman was
kidnapped.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.647
Do we look like kidnappers to
you?

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:04.940
Sean:
What does a kidnapper look
like?

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.525
♪You, you, you♪

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:07.693
You.

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:08.443
♪♪

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.945
Tara:
Without any proof of our
innocence,

00:01:09.945 --> 00:01:11.655
Tara:
the damage is already done.

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:12.864
I can fix this.

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.449
♪♪

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.742
Tara:
You sure you know what you're
doing?

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.828
No, but I can't go back.

00:01:17.828 --> 00:01:19.621
Catherine:
Nobody buys me as a mother.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:21.039
♪♪

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:22.708
I'll always be a CEO first.

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:23.417
♪♪

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:25.294
Executive:
Play along, there's no other
option.

00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:27.170
First page in the playbook.

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.799
Except I don't remember the
chapter on the kidnap of your
only child.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:33.844
♪♪

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:38.348
Interviewer:
You're being asked to
communicate in order to free your only child.

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:41.476
Interviewer:
These people want you to tell
the truth.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:42.644
Aadesh:
We're getting deeper in.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:46.398
There is still a chance that
people may understand everything
you've done until now.

00:01:46.398 --> 00:01:47.858
♪♪

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:50.736
You have underestimated
these people right from the
beginning.

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:55.157
♪♪

00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.284
Man:
The truth will come out.

00:01:57.284 --> 00:02:01.788
♪♪

